I think so too!

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:28.340
I'm scared!

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:30.640
What a gross and perverted look!

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:32.700
I think so too!

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:34.340
Do you understand now?

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:36.480
In the mountains,

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.850
letting your guard down for
a second will result in this!

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:41.350
He's so convincing...

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.250
Are you for real?

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:45.760
I should show Shinobu this lecture...

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:49.520
...to teach her the harsh
reality of the mountains.

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:52.260
You just want to see her blush.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:53.820
Umm...

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:57.430
Shinobu already left to go mushroom picking.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:14:00.130
Let's go! My Elite Force!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.240
Rescue command scramble!

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:03.740
Go!

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:05.740
Good luck...

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.590
I found some shimeji mushrooms!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.290
I found a bunch over here, too!

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:24.620
See?

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.090
You're right!

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:31.090
Hey! I found a pretty mushroom!

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:32.530
See?

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:37.600
Miyabi... that's...

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.100
A poisonous mushroom... for sure...

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:46.380
On another note,

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:49.940
it's so peaceful today
without Onsokumaru around.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:54.150
How dare you see me, woman!?

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:59.660
Onsokumaru... and everyone else!

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.400
We finally meet princesses.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.970
I can't believe you caused me such trouble...

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:07.730
I'm going to punish you.

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:09.340
Hey, Miyabi!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.340
Stop picking poisonous mushrooms.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:15.070
Ignorance is so scary.

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.080
But, thanks to my quick thinking,

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.810
we were able to avoid the worst.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.450
All you did was eat shimeji mushrooms!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:25.460
But, don't worry!

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.090
Now that we're here...

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:28.150
Sasuke!

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:33.790
It's harmless. It's edible.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:36.700
By the way principal...

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:40.160
...at this rate, we'll be sucked into
Jupiter's gravitational field.

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:43.570
Please think about initiating plan B...

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.470
...of firing the ripple cannon
and changing course!

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.880
Grandma's silver...

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:51.250
I'm a turkey!
Grandma's silver...

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.240
I'm a turkey!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.320
They're totally hallucinating!
They're totally hallucinating!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:58.280
Well, they act like that normally, so...

00:15:58.390 --> 00:15:59.720
Ow ow ow ow ow ow!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.220
Onsokumaru!

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.590
Everything goes wrong when you come!

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:04.820
Go somewhere else...

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.260
O-Onsokumaru?

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:15.570
Come! Eat this mushroom and become one of us!

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:18.270
And come jumping into my arms!

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:21.580
Oh my... now he's acting strange, too...

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.710
Looks like the one he ate was
also a poisonous mushroom...

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.210
Please move back! Leave him to us!

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:30.090
Sasuke! Are you back to normal?

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:33.990
Forget about that! The mushroom rice is ready!

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:36.150
Yay! Thanks for the food!

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:44.170
Be one of us!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:47.430
Join our one-sided love research group!

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.770
Let's talk about love!

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:52.910
No!

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:03.950
Jeez... some things never change...

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:05.710
Who are you?

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.560
The Head Master of the
Ro-gumi Ninja Academy...

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:11.920
Izumi!

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:16.670
Ro

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:19.140
Ro
You caught us in such an
embarrassing moment...

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:19.640
Ro

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:23.940
Ro
I've heard you have a separate
classroom in the mountains...

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:25.630
Pleased to meet you.

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:28.540
I'm Shinobu from the l-gumi.

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:31.670
This is my younger sister, Miyabi.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:34.450
My more than a friend,
less than a lover, Kaede.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.340
My classmate, Sasuke.

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:38.520
And... Huh?

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:39.520
He's gone...

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:42.190
Hey, Izumi! Long time, no see...

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.230
Looks like you haven't
changed, Onsokumaru...

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:46.120
Huh?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:50.060
Onsokumaru, you know the
Head Master of the Ro-gumi?

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:53.840
Yeah, she's my ex-classmate
at the Ninja Academy...

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:57.070
...and I dated her.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:59.040
She was like the wind passing over my body.

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:01.930
Why do you always have to lie like that?

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:07.250
Excuse me...

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:10.950
We never see people from other classes.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.410
Can we talk to them?

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:15.550
Head Master, please?

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:19.830
Nice to meet you, female ninjas!

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:21.220
Hello.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.390
Nice to meet you!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.430
Your uniforms are different!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.400
I've never seen a female ninja before!

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:32.570
Um, we're female ninjas...

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.240
Yes, move like that!

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:38.610
Try to shorten the one-second pause!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.780
Battle Techniques

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:43.020
Oh, sorry girls.

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:45.820
We're in the middle of simulating a battle scene...

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.490
We'll have to say "hi" later.

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:49.590
They're so cool!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:51.890
Hey!

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:56.590
Get some practice with the guys from l-gumi!

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.470
P-Practice? But...

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.670
They're our guests...

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:04.670
I've never practiced with a guy...

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:10.570
Give me what you got, Miss Marshmallows!

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:14.020
If you're able to touch us...

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:16.040
We'll give you candy...

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.260
Well, if that's the case...

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.660
...I want chocolate!

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:21.150
Please don't hurt me!

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.430
Ow! Something is...

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.060
The hanging ceiling technique!
Ow! Something is...

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:23.550
The hanging ceiling technique!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.230
I can't believe you're the Head Master.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.660
I'm so worried about your class.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.910
Don't tell Shinobu the secret...

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:35.800
Secret?

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:42.840
Wait, you mean you haven't told Shinobu yet?

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:46.080
She'll find out when the time comes.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.620
You idiot! What's the point of dragging it out-

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:51.680
I know.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.520
I know...

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:08.000
Hot! That was hot! You bastard!

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:11.240
Please help, Onsokumaru!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.540
We're being chased by ninjas!

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:18.880
Miss Izumi, the girls are bullying us!

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:21.980
What?! My students?

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:25.710
No, please don't get mad at them.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.960
I'm sure they didn't mean any harm!

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:29.620
I'm going home...

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:33.530
Onsoku... Onsokumaru... Onso...

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:37.470
You guys are pathetic!

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.530
Stand right there!

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:49.310
I'll make you into real men!

00:20:58.590 --> 00:20:59.590
She's always had a habit of going
berserk when she sees a weak guy...

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:02.360
Ow! Stop! Please! Shinobu!
She's always had a habit of going
berserk when she sees a weak guy...

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:03.920
She's always had a habit of going
berserk when she sees a weak guy...

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:14.230
Miyabi, don't be so informal. It's embarrassing.

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:15.830
We don't care.

00:21:16.310 --> 00:21:18.480
Yeah, we're all female ninjas.

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:20.000
There's no need to act so serious.

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:21.730
Yeah! She's right.

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.550
Okay! Thank you!

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.540
Also, thanks for the tea!

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:28.350
Hot...

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:31.680
Shinobu is always happy and cheerful...

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:35.980
At that moment, I had no idea how heavy...

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:39.430
...a fate she had on her small shoulders.

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:00.610
Shuu tata shuu tata!

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:04.020
Hurry up!

00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:07.820
Shuu tata shuu tata!

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:09.480
Gather around!
Shugou

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:18.100
Made it in the nick of time, I slid in
Giri giri seefu suberikonde

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:25.100
I jumped over the tough morning
Kibishii asa wo tobikoeta

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:27.940
"What you said yesterday..."
Kinou no hanashi

00:22:28.180 --> 00:22:32.010
"...might have been a little white lie,"you said
chotto dake uso kamo nante

00:22:33.380 --> 00:22:38.080
I definitely have a long way to go with my training,
Yappari shugyou busoku

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:39.850
Let's do it!
Ganbarou

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:43.760
Turn turn turn, one day I'll become great
Kuru kuru ri, rippa ni naru hi ga

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:46.890
Turn turn turn, turn turn turn
Kuru kuru rii, kuru kuru rin

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:50.530
It's okay
Daijoubu

00:22:50.730 --> 00:22:54.600
"With prayer, flowers bloom," someone said
Nenzureba hana hiraku nante

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:57.840
It's an unreliable philosophy
Tayori nai hitori goto

00:22:58.680 --> 00:23:03.310
But I've got to try!
Demo ganbaranakucha

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:05.610
Shuu tata shuu tata!

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:09.050
Hurry up!

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:12.820
Shuu tata shuu tata!

00:23:13.560 --> 00:23:14.420
Break it up!
Kaisan

00:23:17.130 --> 00:23:18.060
Hurry up!

00:23:21.260 --> 00:23:23.870
What's wrong Shinobu? You seem down.

00:23:23.870 --> 00:23:25.600
Onsokumaru's playfulness
has gone too far and...

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:28.040
...something terrible has
happened at the ninja manor.

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:30.800
Cheer up, Shinobu! You have me!

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:33.640
When you say that, it makes me so happy!

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:37.140
Leave it to Kaede Shiranui
to resurrect the ninja manor!

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:39.480
Let's start with the Ninja Item
Development Department...

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:41.070
Next episode of 2x2=Shinobuden!

00:23:41.320 --> 00:23:42.940
"Onsokumaru is Stuck" and...

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:43.920
"Shinobu Plays Ball"!

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:44.550
Onsokumaru is Stuck
Shinobu Plays Ball
"Shinobu Plays Ball"!

00:23:44.550 --> 00:23:44.750
Onsokumaru is Stuck
Shinobu Plays Ball

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:47.090
Onsokumaru is Stuck
Shinobu Plays Ball
Kaede, you seem a bit out of character today...

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:47.790
Onsokumaru is Stuck
Shinobu Plays Ball

00:23:47.790 --> 00:23:48.860
Onsokumaru is Stuck
Shinobu Plays Ball
You think so?

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:49.480
Onsokumaru is Stuck
Shinobu Plays Ball
